  _headline: "Cidade \xE0s escuras"
  _headlineEn: City goes dark
  _body: "Sem energia, param sem\xE1foros, bombas de \xE1gua e comunica\xE7\xE3o.
    A prefeitura promete explica\xE7\xE3o assim que achar a lanterna."
  _bodyEn: No power means no traffic lights, water pumps or communications. City
    Hall promises answers as soon as it finds a flashlight.
